{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"account-default","id":"msg_011Cgyp4NkZ4ZMayFAJEjVDb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This plan needs a human to review it before anyone applies it.\n\nThe plan changes one production database: it resizes the orders database (`aws_db_instance.orders`, `tallowmark-prod-orders`) from `db.r6g.large` to `db.r6g.xlarge`. The rules send any database change to a person, so I can't approve it. Nothing in it is a reason to block, because it has no IAM policies or wildcards.\n\nWhat the reviewer should check:\n- **Downtime:** resizing the database restarts it. On a single-zone database, orders and checkout will be down during the restart. On a multi-zone setup it's a short failover.\n- **When it runs:** the plan doesn't show `apply_immediately`. If that's true, the change applies as soon as someone runs it. Otherwise it waits for the next maintenance window. Either way, it shouldn't land during an on-sale.\n- **Cost:** the larger size costs roughly twice as much.\n\nI didn't run anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":824,"cache_read_input_tokens":3401,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":824},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c855ef2-3e1a-4095-b7ab-1d0b721c58a4","uuid":"e8eff8e7-19ab-4182-a4b7-d33deef704ce","timestamp":"2026-11-12T22:20:20.114Z","request_id":"req_011Cgyp4NZ9tAQm5prVRf5LQ"}
